    <section class="references" id="sect-00015">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00039">Alisoy, H. Effective strategies in primary second language education. <emphasis effect="italics">Preprints</emphasis> 2024, Article 2024010330. https://doi.org/10.20944/preprints202401.0330.v1</para>
